          "scene_number": 2,
          "timestamp_end": "0:02",
          "timestamp_start": "0:01"
        },
        {
          "audio": "Then I'll tell it: extract the product information and images from this link, and help me make a set of Amazon product images in English.",
          "label": "Product Selling Points",
          "visual": "The camera zooms in on the dialogue box where text is being typed. The text instructions specify extracting product info and images to create a set of four Amazon listing images in English. The background details of the website become slightly blurred as the focus intensifies on the typed commands.",
          "shot_type": "Close-Up",
          "scene_number": 3,
          "timestamp_end": "0:06",
          "timestamp_start": "0:02"
        },
        {
          "audio": "Make four images: a main image on a white background, a selling point image, a detail image, and a lifestyle image.",
          "label": "Usage Scenarios",
          "visual": "The typing continues, specifying the four types of images: main image with a white background, selling point image, detail image, and lifestyle image. The movement is steady and purposeful, highlighting each specific requirement as it appears on screen.",
